{
  "uid": "ci-investigation",
  "title": "CI Investigation",
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "job_type",
        "label": "Job Type",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\"}, job_name)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "pr_number",
        "label": "PR",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}, pr_number)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 3
      },
      {
        "name": "build_id",
        "label": "Build",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}, build_id)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 3
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 50,
      "title": "Dashboard Guide",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 51,
          "title": "",
          "type": "text",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 10,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 1
          },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "### How to use this dashboard\n\nUse this dashboard to investigate CI failures for a specific PR or build.\n\n**Workflow:**\n1. Set **PR Number** to compare your PR's success rate against the global baseline. If both are low, the problem is systemic (infrastructure). If only yours is low, investigate your code.\n2. Check **PR Retry History** to see how many times each commit (SHA) was retested. High retry counts with mixed pass/fail on the same SHA = flaky tests or infrastructure.\n3. Look at **Step Failure Leaderboard** to see which ci-operator steps fail most often. Frequent failures in a specific step suggest a targeted fix.\n4. Check **Pod Phase Breakdown** for the ratio of succeeded vs failed pods. A high failure rate suggests cluster resource pressure.\n5. Set **Build ID** and expand **Build Logs** to see error events and failed pods for a specific run. Copy build IDs from the CI Overview outlier tables.\n\n**Filters:**\n- **Job Type** -- same as CI Overview, narrows to specific job types.\n- **PR Number** -- leave empty to see all PRs, or enter a number to focus on one.\n- **Build ID** -- required for the Build Logs panels. Paste from outlier tables or Prow."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Context",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "PR Success Rate vs Global",
      "description": "Compare a specific PR's success rate to the overall system. If both are low, it's systemic. If only yours is low, investigate your code.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",success=\"true\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__interval:])) / count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__interval:])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Global",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "3h"
        },
        {
          "expr": "count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",success=\"true\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__interval:])) / count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__interval:])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Selected PRs",
          "refId": "B",
          "interval": "3h"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Global"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "blue",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "PR.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "yellow",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "PR Retry History",
      "description": "How many times each commit (SHA) was retested and the success rate. High retry count with mixed results = flaky.",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 22
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(20, sum by (pr_number, pr_sha) (count_over_time((group by (build_id, pr_number, pr_sha) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__range:])))",
          "legendFormat": "PR {{pr_number}} ({{pr_sha}})",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "minVizWidth": 0,
        "minVizHeight": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Pipeline Runs",
      "description": "Each tile is a pipeline run. Grouped by PR and commit SHA. Size = duration, color = success (green) or failure (red).",
      "type": "marcusolsson-treemap-panel",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "last_over_time(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",build_id=~\"$build_id\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}[$__range])",
          "legendFormat": "PR {{pr_number}}/{{pr_sha}}/{{build_id}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "reduce",
          "options": {
            "reducers": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "labelsToFields": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tiling": "treemapSquarify",
        "separator": "/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "title": "Build Logs",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 5,
          "title": "Error Events",
          "description": "All error-level events for the selected build.",
          "type": "logs",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 12,
            "w": 12,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 33
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "pr_number:~\"$pr_number\" AND build_id:~\"$build_id\" AND level:Error",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "showTime": true,
            "showLabels": true,
            "wrapLogMessage": true,
            "enableLogDetails": true,
            "sortOrder": "Descending"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "title": "Failed Pods",
          "description": "Pods that failed in the selected build. Look for OOMKilled, ImagePull errors, scheduling failures.",
          "type": "logs",
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 12,
            "w": 12,
            "x": 12,
            "y": 45
          },
          "datasource": {
            "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "pr_number:~\"$pr_number\" AND build_id:~\"$build_id\" AND source:pod AND (pod_phase:Failed OR _msg:~\"Failed|Error\")",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "showTime": true,
            "showLabels": true,
            "wrapLogMessage": true,
            "enableLogDetails": true,
            "sortOrder": "Descending"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39
}
